# FleetDesk — Cursor Rules
Read this file before making ANY changes to the codebase.
These rules are mandatory.

## Stack
React + TypeScript + Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Supabase, Bun

## Critical Files — NEVER rewrite
- src/pages/ContractDetail.tsx
- src/integrations/supabase/client.ts
- src/integrations/supabase/types.ts
- src/App.tsx

## Rules
1. One task, max 2 files per session
2. Never rewrite entire files — only targeted edits
3. Style changes = never touch data fetching logic
4. New features = new files only
5. Never modify App.tsx without confirmation
6. Always report exactly what changed and what was not changed
7. Stop and ask if task requires touching ContractDetail.tsx or Supabase files